transition-colors [&amp;&gt;svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3 bg-secondary text-muted-foreground">Active</span></header><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-foreground">A populated component has no manufacturer part number.</p><dl class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3"><div><dt class="text-xs uppercase text-muted-foreground">Path</dt><dd class="text-sm text-foreground"><code>hardware/main.kicad_sch</code></dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs uppercase text-muted-foreground">Kind</dt><dd class="text-sm text-foreground">Bom</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs uppercase text-muted-foreground">Waived</dt><dd class="text-sm text-foreground">—</dd></div></dl><div class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><p><strong class="text-foreground">Corrective action:</strong> Update the source design file (<code>hardware/main.kicad_sch</code>) in your CAD tool to resolve bom.missing-mpn.</p><p class="mt-1"><small>Rerun required to verify: Push updated commit to trigger re-analysis in GitHub Actions.</small></p></div></li></ul></section></div></div><div class="mt-4"></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="mt-auto border-t border-border px-6 py-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><p>BoardReadyOps checks whether a board is ready to fabricate. Your repository and its full workflow logs stay the source of truth.</p></footer></div></div><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events:none"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-100 flex w-88 max-w-[calc(100vw-2rem)] flex-col gap-2 outline-none"></ol></div>",
